          "_name": "news05",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"news05\" group=\"News\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" value=\"6\" step=\"1\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Event\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Date\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n          <b>Upcoming events with images</b>\n        </h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.</h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image mb-5 active\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}}\">\n        <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"../_images/hightlights/6.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg item-wrapper\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>關於吃</b></h5>\n        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">我堅信美食是電影裡最重要的配角。\n<div>從巷口滷肉飯到異國料理，只要能讓眼睛發亮、讓胃滿足的，都是好雷。我吃的不只是味道，是當下的氣氛跟陪你吃的人。住在新莊的好處就是——小吃多、宵夜方便，半夜想吃東西永遠不會孤單。</div></h6>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"></p>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center item features-without-image mb-5\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} \">\n        <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"../_images/hightlights/10.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-lg item-wrapper\">\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>關於旅行</b></h5>\n        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">和同學一起去過日本福岡。\n<div>那趟旅程教會我：旅行最迷人的不是景點，是迷路時一起笑出來的那群人。福岡的屋台、拉麵、還有街角的寧靜，到現在都還存在我的腦內硬碟裡。</div></h6>\n        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"></p>\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vxg0T7b1QD",
          "_anchor": "news05-6",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "overflow": "hidden",
              "background": "@rowColor",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".text-wrapper": {
              "padding": "4rem 3rem 4rem 1rem",
              "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "2.25rem"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "1.5rem"
              }
            },
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              },
              ".text-wrapper": {
                "padding": "4rem 2rem 4rem 3rem",
                "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                  "padding": "2.25rem"
                },
                "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                  "padding": "1.5rem"
                }
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-right": "-1rem",
              "margin-left": "-1rem"
            },
            ".image-wrapper": {
              "padding": "0 1rem"
            },
            "img, .image-wrapper": {
              "height": "(@imageHeight * 100px)",
              "object-fit": "cover",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "max-height": "350px"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".price": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            },
            ".mbr-section-maintitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-mainsubtitle": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_name": "news06",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"news06\" group=\"News\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <header>Image</header>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Height\" name=\"imageHeight\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\" checked>\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Main Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Main Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Price\" name=\"showPrice\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n    <header>Color</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"rowColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mbr-section-maintitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-maintitle\">\n          <b>Our events</b>\n        </h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4 mbr-section-mainsubtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-mainsubtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Praesent vitae erat. Integer aliquam, lorem\n          vitae dapibus sollicitudin, nibh nisl egestas enim, ut dapibus odio augue tempus venenatis mi\n          semper.\n        </h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center align-items-center item features-image\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 \">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n              <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-1.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg col-md-12\">\n              <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>關於技能</b></h5>\n                <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\">我有一張急救證照。\n<br>不是因為我愛冒險，而是我覺得——能接住別人，是一件很帥的事。\n<br>以備不時之需，也期許自己成為那個在關鍵時刻不會慌張的人。</p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                  <a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                    Learn more\n                  </a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center align-items-center item features-image\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n              <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg col-md-12\">\n              <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>一句話總結我這個人</b></h5>\n                <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\">我是張宸翌，住新莊，喜歡看別人的故事，也正在努力把自己的故事拍得好看。\n<br>\n<br>如果你也愛電影、愛吃、愛旅行，或者剛好需要一個不會在緊急時刻尖叫的朋友——\n<br>歡迎來找我，我們可以從一頓飯或一場電影開始。&nbsp;<br></p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"></p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                  <a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vxg2h1Jjje",
          "_anchor": "news06-8",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}